<title>USA: Digital gets $26 mln agency contract.</title>
<headline>Digital gets $26 mln agency contract.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said Tuesday it has received a $26 million purchase order from the Department of Veterans Affairs.</p>
<p>Under the contract, Digital is to upgrade 100 VA medical centers across the United States with advanced Digital Alpha-based Hospital Information Systems.</p>
<p>The Digital HIS is designed to provide the VA with greater capacity, higher performance, and increased efficiency in managing clinical and administrative information.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
